=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Include request-parameters setting in metadataConfig](#discussion_r4214330303)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Add Servlet 5.0 test for setCaptureUserName](#discussion_r4214330276)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Add Servlet 3.0 test for setCaptureUserName](#discussion_r4214330251)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Fix unresolved UserIncubatingAttributes Javadoc link](#discussion_r4214330356)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Add user.name setting metadata to all app-server modules](#discussion_r4214330332)\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Previously missed (2)</strong></summary>\n\nIn code that hasn't changed since last review\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Add servlet user-name capture test to instrumentation CI</summary>\n\n`instrumentation/\u200bservlet/\u200bservlet-3.0/\u200bjavaagent-testing/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts:35`\n\n[Testing] This new task is wired into `check`, but instrumentation CI invokes the explicit tasks listed in `.github/scripts/instrumentations.sh`; that list currently contains only `servlet:servlet-3.0:javaagent-testing:test`. As a result, the enabled user-name path is not exercised in the instrumentation CI matrix. Add `servlet:servlet-3.0:javaagent-testing:testUserNameCapture` to that list.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Add Tomcat fallback-path test to instrumentation CI</summary>\n\n`instrumentation/\u200btomcat/\u200btomcat-10.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts:35`\n\n[Testing] This new task is wired into `check`, but instrumentation CI invokes the explicit tasks listed in `.github/scripts/instrumentations.sh`; Tomcat 10 currently lists only `test` and `testExperimental`. Therefore the enabled fallback-path assertion is skipped by the instrumentation CI matrix. Add `tomcat:tomcat-10.0:javaagent:testUserNameCapture` to that list.\n</details>\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\nGive feedback about Copilot approvals in [this survey](https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/9011660/CCR-Public-Preview-Autoapprove-feedback-survey) to enter a drawing for a $150 gift card.","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5451732709","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5451732709},{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nThe two new identity-capture test tasks are absent from the instrumentation CI task list and therefore are not executed there.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>2 open findings</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Register user-name capture task in instrumentation CI](#discussion_r4215049013) \u00b7 New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Register Tomcat user-name capture task in instrumentation CI](#discussion_r4215049091) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\nGive feedback about Copilot approvals in [this survey](https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/9011660/CCR-Public-Preview-Autoapprove-feedback-survey) to enter a drawing for a $150 gift card.","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5451800744","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5451800744},{"body":"[Testing] This custom task is not registered in `.github/scripts/instrumentations.sh`, where instrumentation CI currently runs only `servlet:servlet-3.0:javaagent-testing:test`. Depending on `check` does not make the task part of that direct task invocation, so the enabled user-name capture path is skipped in CI. Add `servlet:servlet-3.0:javaagent-testing:testUserNameCapture` to the instrumentation task list.","comment_commit_id":"35a111568702665770272becc20ebba2be07e856","comment_id":4215049013,"key":"inline:4215049013","kind":"inline","line":35,"original_commit_id":"35a111568702665770272becc20ebba2be07e856","original_line":35,"path":"instrumentation/servlet/servlet-3.0/javaagent-testing/build.gradle.kts","review_commit_id":"35a111568702665770272becc20ebba2be07e856","review_id":5451800744,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-08T05:14:59Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"7751011c155b1d720a5042bf7b661c14747ba4bda53c2a8084c8e8dd2cf56914","id":4215049013,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-08T05:14:59Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86qNXoN"},{"body":"[Testing] This new test variant is wired only into Gradle `check`, but instrumentation CI invokes tasks from `.github/scripts/instrumentations.sh` directly; that list currently contains `tomcat-10.0:javaagent:test` and `testExperimental`, not `testUserNameCapture`. Consequently the enabled configuration branch and app-server-owned span fallback are not exercised in CI. Add `tomcat:tomcat-10.0:javaagent:testUserNameCapture` to the instrumentation task list.","comment_commit_id":"35a111568702665770272becc20ebba2be07e856","comment_id":4215049091,"key":"inline:4215049091","kind":"inline","line":35,"original_commit_id":"35a111568702665770272becc20ebba2be07e856","original_line":35,"path":"instrumentation/tomcat/tomcat-10.0/javaagent/build.gradle.kts","review_commit_id":"35a111568702665770272becc20ebba2be07e856","review_id":5451800744,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-08T05:14:59Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"0d6f0a4129545a27d00c2076b1dba27a972635dfbae478df743e45ffcff34687","id":4215049091,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-08T05:14:59Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86qNXo-"}],"frozen_at":1791442435,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-08T06:53:55Z","frozen_sha":"35a111568702665770272becc20ebba2be07e856","head_ref":"copilot/adopt-user-identity-conventions","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37740164651},"loop_